public class Solution {
    public boolean isPowerOfThree(int n) {
        if (n <= 0) return false;
        return Math.log(n) / Math.log(3) % 1 == 0;
    }
}
```

This solution uses logarithms to determine if `n` is a power of 3 in O(1) time complexity.

